OL,3,AUnexpected UK borrowing surge adds to
OL,4,Apre-Budget pressure on chancellor
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation rose to its highest rate in
OL,7,Ffive months in August in the UK, driven
OL,8,Fup by higher petrol and diesel prices.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
